<table class="news-table" border="1" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Dec 15, 2003 :: Arglar named King of the Dwarves.. </div><P>Well, maybe not, but Arglar got his big war! Okies, this update is late, but it's only Arg.. </P>
<P>Thanks folks for coming out to the Great Divide to do Arglar's Ring War. Looks like 23 of us started this little war, and we were kept quite busy! Everyone worked harder than ever and of course we succeeded! </P>
<P>Grats Arglar on your ring, Shatta on your choker, Morlith on the faceguard and hell must of frozen over because Vorne finally won the Crown of Narandi! Sadly for us, it has no graphic so we're forced to look at his ugly mug. I forget who won the greed rolls on the lance, earring, and eye. </P>
<P>Some leveling updates!<BR>Grats Yimmah on 64! <BR>Grats Tryder and Bashiuss on 63! <BR>Grats Kasiryn on 62!<BR>Grats Aelfric on 59!<BR>Grats Shatta on 52!<BR>Grats Hedonista on 47!</P>
<P>Hopefully didn't miss anyone!</P><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka<br> :: Last edited by Meeka on Dec 16, 2003</p></td></tr></table><p /><table class="news-table" border="1" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Dec 13, 2003 :: Gnews!!</div><P align=center><FONT color=#0000ff size=1>Grats Thayet on 65 and Arch Convoker!!! Muhahha</FONT></P>
<P align=left><FONT color=#ffffff size=2>Grats Aridius on 65 and Maestro!<BR>Grats Anarandil on 64!<BR>Grats Cimerene on 63!<BR>Grats Mytee on 62!<BR>Grats Kasiryn on 61!<BR>Grats Lumalie on 60 and Phantasmist!<BR>Grats Edenstar on 55 and Beguiler!<BR>Grats Leviathaun on 52!<BR>Grats Shatta on 51 and Vicar!</FONT></P>
<P align=left><FONT color=#ffffff size=2>Grats Neola on your shissar snakey epic!! Will have to sneak into the Nexus and get a picture, or put the dwarf on the job!</FONT></P><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka<br> :: Last edited by Wonderous on Dec 17, 2003</p></td></tr></table><p /><table class="news-table" border="1" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Dec 10, 2003 :: Hail to the King, baby.. </div><IMG alt="" hspace=0 src="http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/kingkazon.jpg" align=baseline border=0><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka</p></td></tr></table><p /><table class="news-table" border="1" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Dec 9, 2003 :: Arglar made Marshall! </div><P>Not recently, but I forgot to mention it and had to talk him back from the edge of a building due to it. So, this post is for the little guy!</P>
<P><IMG alt="Look ma! A Marshall! Not a crappy Veteran!" hspace=0 src="http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/argmarshall.jpg" align=baseline border=0></P>
<P>Killed the trash pile tonight for a few more flags and some fun! Juhel kindly split up the mobs for mezzing to make the chanter's job easier, and Balut went linkdead at the start of fights. Good stuff! </P><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka<br> :: Last edited by Meeka on Dec 10, 2003</p></td></tr></table><p /><table class="news-table" border="1" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Dec 8, 2003 :: Piling the last several days into one post!</div><P>Hopefully I won't forget too much here! </P>
<P>Morlith got married (for real)! And bunches of us were there, even in a blizzard. </P>
<P>Jenrenee finished her epic <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics14/Fiery_Defender.jpg">Fiery Defender</A>!</P>
<P>Headed down to visit the royal family of Chardok, grats Wellish on King and Garetjax on Queen! Just need the green scale for GJ now!</P>
<P>Klandicar died twice, giving Zelcon and Bearspirit&nbsp;a nice shiny new talisman!</P>
<P>Ixblat Fer made an appearance for Wellish, helping him inch towards his epicdom. </P>
<P>Ragefire was spawned and killed in 40 seconds without the use of Harm Touches (yes, we timed it for fun). We did not beat our record, sadly. Maybe if some folks didn't go linkdead before the fight we would have! Grats Wellish on your <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/fpics/water_sprinkler_of_nem_ankh.jpg">Water Sprinkler on Nem Ankh</A>! </P>
<P>Dain was up and taunting us with his little beady eyes, so we killed him fast before Firestormers started a Ring War (which was good, cause they lost and he would have despawned on us, and that would&nbsp; have sucked). Grats Grajin on a little <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=16177">dwarf head</A>... giving head to KT gets you a <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics15/belt_dwarfslaying.JPG">shiny belt</A>, Fezz on a<A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics15/Triplated_golden_hackle_hammer.JPG"> tri plated hammer of goldness</A> or something like that. Jakr saved the <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics15/frostreavers_velium_crown.jpg">crown</A> from rotting and Aridius won a <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics15/Ring_of_Winter.jpg">ring</A> on the greed roll. </P>
<P><IMG alt="Not feet!" hspace=0 src="http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/dain.jpg" align=baseline border=0></P>
<P>Vox and Nagafen both died, and GJ got a red scale to turn into a green scale with a little work. </P>
<P>Levels I've missed...<BR>Thayet on 65 and Arch Convoker!<BR>Zavitar on 65 and Coercer!<BR>Aridius on 64!<BR>Valenae and Corseil on 62!<BR>Juhel and Mytee on 61!<BR>Ladibugg on 60 and Heirophant!<BR>Moordread on 60 and Warlock (I think it is)!<BR>Grats Zorin on 59!<BR></P><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka<br> :: Last edited by Meeka on Dec 9, 2003</p></td></tr></table><p /><table class="news-table" border="1" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Dec 3, 2003 :: Catching up!</div><P>Sorry all, with Morlith's wedding only a few days away, I've been working on my dress! </P>
<P>Belated thanks for those that came out to kill Sont the other day to get Myschief her talisman!</P>
<P>Leveling grats, hopefully I'm not missing too many or repeating myself...<BR>Grats Bashiuss and Darkyn on 62...Twins!<BR>Grats Velenae on 60 and Warlock!<BR>Grats Valoura on 56!<BR>Grats Ewlala on 55!<BR><BR></P><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka<br> :: Last edited by Meeka on Dec 8, 2003</p></td></tr></table><p /><table class="news-table" border="1" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Nov 29, 2003 :: Yelinak dead again!</div><P>Yelinak decided to donate some more toys to us after the ring war. Nice work all, as always! </P>
<P>Grats Aridius on <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics15/yelinakshead.jpg">Yelinak's Head</A> (to make <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics15/gauntletsodslaying.jpg">Gauntlets of Dragon Slaying</A>), Antroe on <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics15/yelinaks_talisman.JPG">Yelinak's Talisman</A>, Bearspirit on <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics15/dragonseyesagering.jpg">Dragon Eye Sage Ring</A>, Colwn and Reide each saved a <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/rpics/soul_defiler.jpg">Soul Defiler</A> from rotting and Jakr won the greed roll on the <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics15/maskofthedragonslayer.jpg">Mask of the Dragon Slayer</A>. </P><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka<br> :: Last edited by Meeka on Dec 9, 2003</p></td></tr></table><p /><table class="news-table" border="1" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Nov 29, 2003 :: Arglar wears a dress!</div><P>As promised, Arglar tanked in a dress with an illusion on if Greylok would do her own Ring War. And I took pictures! </P>
<P>Nice work, as always! Grats Greylok on <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics16/ring_dain_frostweaver.jpg">Ring of Dain Frostreaver IV</A>, Cerdiwan on <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/rpics/crown_of_narandi.jpg">Crown of Narandi</A>, Sparkley on <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics16/Choker_of_the_Wretched.jpg">Choker of the Wretched</A>, Veleria on <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics16/faceguard_bentos_hero.jpg">Faceguard of Bentos the Hero</A>, Antroe on greed roll of <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=6789">Eye of Narandi</A>, Leviathaun on greed roll of <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics16/narandis_lance.jpg">Narandi's Lance</A>&nbsp;and Mahrsan on greed roll of the Earring of the Frozen Skull. </P>
<P><IMG alt=Mwahaha! hspace=0 src="http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/argdress.jpg" align=baseline border=0></P>
<P>Some leveling grats, some old, some new!<BR>Grats Tellie on 65 and Arcanist!<BR>Grats Thayet on 63!<BR>Grats Mytee on 60 and Phantasmist!<BR>Grats Kasiryn on 59!<BR>Grats Moordread on 58!<BR>Grats Tidark on 54!<BR>Grats Tristastar on 52! <BR>Grats Leviathuan on 51 and Champion!<BR></P><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka</p></td></tr></table><p /><span class="page-scroll">Pages: <a href='news.asp?page=5'>&laquo;</a>&nbsp;<a href='news.asp?page=1'>1</a>...<a href='news.asp?page=4'>4</a> <a href='news.asp?page=5'>5</a> 6 <a href='news.asp?page=7'>7</a> <a href='news.asp?page=8'>8</a>...<a href='news.asp?page=13'>13</a>&nbsp;<a href='news.asp?page=7'>&raquo;</a></span></td>
